        "problem": "Determine if a number is even/odd. Cycle through days of week. Wrap array indices.",
        "steps": [
          "Even check: n % 2 == 0",
          "Day of week: (day + offset) % 7",
          "Circular buffer: index % length"
        ],
        "code": "def is_even(n):\n    return n % 2 == 0\n\ndays = ["Mon", "Tue", "Wed", "Thu", "Fri", "Sat", "Sun"]\ntoday = 2  # Wednesday\nprint(days[(today + 3) % 7])  # Saturday",
        "explanation": "Modulo is essential for cyclic/wrapping behavior."
      }
